{"name":"Devilcore","title":"Devilcore","revision":236544,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Devilcore","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Devilcore is an aesthetic that draws inspiration from the grotesque, eerie, and seductive. It often utilizes occult and Satanic imagery, particularly in moodboards. It shares elements with the Horror genre, especially Catholic Horror, and contrasts with Angelcore."},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Devilcore fashion typically incorporates dark colors, especially black and red, and may include tight or revealing clothing, bold patterns (such as stripes or flames), and sacrilegious motifs. Materials like fishnet, lace, and leather are common, and accessories such as chains, buckles, harnesses, and chokers are often used. Devilcore fashion may also feature demonic imagery, such as horns or pointed tails. Makeup is typically heavy and dark."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visual"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Devilcore often uses disturbing or graphic imagery, text boxes and pictures implying sinful activities. Images used in these aesthetics may include satanic imagery like inverted pentagrams, the Leviathan Cross and demonic sigils, as well as common creepy aesthetic imagry such as:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blood/Gore"},{"kind":"list","text":"Knives"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wires"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cigarettes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bloody weapons"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fires"},{"kind":"list","text":"Abandoned buildings"},{"kind":"list","text":"The night sky"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Devilcore fashion is based on dark colors, creepy accessories, and also religious symbols. Devilcore fashion is considered edgy and is related to dark alternative styles such as Goth/Gothic. Devilcore fashion may include:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dark colors, mainly reds and blacks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tight and/or revealing clothing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bold patterns Stripes, flames, anything sacrilegious"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jeans Black, acid wash, ripped Applies for jean shorts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Short skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chains, buckles, harnesses, bondage wear"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fishnet, lace, leather"},{"kind":"list","text":"Devil and demon motifs such as horns or pointed tails"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chokers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Heavy dark makeup"},{"kind":"list","text":"Boots, high heels, sneakers"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"TV Shows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Buffy the Vampire Slayer (1997-2003)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lucy, the Daughter of the Devil (2005)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Supernatural (2005-2020)"},{"kind":"list","text":"IMP (2006-2007)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jimmy Two-Shoes (2009-2012)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lucifer"},{"kind":"list","text":"Supernatural"},{"kind":"list","text":"Castlevania (2017-2021)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chilling Adventures of Sabrina (2018-2020)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hellraiser"},{"kind":"list","text":"Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba (2019)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chainsaw Man (2022)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hazbin Hotel (2024-present)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Helluva Boss (2019-present)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Satina (2019-present)"},{"kind":"list","text":"My Babysitter’s A Vampire (2011-2012)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Little Demon (2022)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Anime/Manga"},{"kind":"list","text":"Devilman and Devilman Crybaby"},{"kind":"list","text":"Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chainsaw Man"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tomie"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hellsing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hell Girl"},{"kind":"list","text":"Black Butler (mixed with Dark Academia)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blue Exorcist"},{"kind":"list","text":"Overlord"},{"kind":"list","text":"Castlevania"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Comic Books"}